  "definitions": {
    "regional_attribution": "FY and Q4FY windows compare 2025 to 2024. Regions are APMEA, Canada, Europe, Latin America and United States. Contribution divides regional purchase-volume change by reported worldwide purchase-volume change. Average purchase is purchase dollars per purchase transaction.",
